Base: box-sizing, body font system stack, bg, color.

`.app-shell { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }`

Topbar: sticky? no. white, border-bottom, padding 16px 28px, flex space-between, wrap.

Brand mark: 36px square with gradient, white letter, radius 10.

h1 16px 600; p 12px muted.

Tenant chip: pill with dot and mono timezone.

Actor picker: label small uppercase, select.

Content: max-width 1180px, margin auto, padding 28px 24px 64px, width 100%.

Page heading: h2 22px, p 14 muted.

Card: white, border, radius 14, shadow-sm, overflow hidden.

Toolbar: flex, gap, padding 14px 16px, border-bottom, wrap.

Search field: relative, flex 1 min-width 260px, input padding-left 34px, height 36, radius 8, border.

Table: width 100%, border-collapse collapse; th text-left, 12px uppercase letter-spacing, muted, bg #fafbfc, border-bottom, padding 10px 16px; sticky header? Since page scrolls, `thead th { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1; background: #fafbfc; }` inside table wrap with overflow-x auto only (no vertical scroll) — sticky within page works if table-wrap doesn't scroll vertically; sticky relative to viewport fine.

td padding 12px 16px, border-bottom, 14px.

row hover bg #f8fafc; row-clickable cursor pointer; focus-visible outline.

mono: font-family ui-monospace.

badge: inline-flex, gap 6, padding 2px 8px, radius 999, 12px, border.

badge-active: green; badge-revoked: gray/red.

skeleton: gradient animation.

table-state: padding 48px, centered text.

pagination: flex space-between, padding 12px 16px, border-top.

page-button: min-width 32, height 32, border, radius 8, background white; is-current accent.

banner: padding 10px 12px, radius 8, border, flex space-between; error red tint, success green, info blue.

drawer-overlay: fixed inset 0, background rgba(15,23,42,0.35), display flex, justify-content flex-end, z-index 50.

drawer: width min(520px, 100%), background white, height 100%, overflow-y auto, box-shadow, animation slideIn.

drawer-header: flex space-between, padding 20px 22px, border-bottom, sticky top 0 bg white z-index.

drawer-body: padding 20px 22px.

detail-grid: grid 1fr 1fr gap 16 20; dt 11px uppercase muted; dd 14px margin 4px 0 0; divs.

timeline: list-style none, padding-left 18px, border-left? Use custom.

Actually simpler: `.timeline { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 16px; }` `.timeline li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 12px 1fr; gap: 10px; position: relative; }` with dot.

modal-overlay: fixed inset 0, rgba, display grid place-items center, padding 24, z-index 60.

modal: width min(720px, 100%), max-height calc(100vh - 48px), overflow auto, bg white, radius 14, shadow-lg.

modal-header/body/actions.

field: display grid gap 6; span 12px 600 muted uppercase? Use 12px 600.

input/select/textarea: padding 9px 11px, border, radius 8, font inherit, focus ring.

btn: height 36, padding 0 14, radius 8, font 14 600, border 1px transparent, cursor pointer, transitions; primary accent white; secondary white border; ghost transparent; danger red.

btn:disabled opacity .55 cursor not-allowed.

stats-grid: 3 cols, gap 12; stat bg #f8fafc border radius 10 padding 12; value 20px 650; label 12 muted.

summary-chips: flex wrap gap 8; chip padding 4px 10px radius 999 font 13 border.

outcome-table: width 100%, border-collapse; th/td padding 8px 10px, border-bottom, font 13.

badge-outcome-issued green, skipped amber, failed red.

toast: fixed bottom right, bg #111827 white, radius 10, padding 12 16, shadow-lg, z-index 70, animation.

sr-only utility.

.mono class.

Muted.

Responsive breakpoints: 900px → header stack; toolbar wrap; detail-grid 1 col; hide some columns? Keep horizontal scroll for table via `.table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }`.

Focus-visible outlines.

`@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` disable animations.

Animations: fadeIn for overlay, slideIn for drawer, popIn modal, shimmer skeleton.

